---
import StudioFrame from '../../components/StudioFrame.astro';
import { studioSteps } from '../../data/studio';
---

<StudioFrame title="我的相册家谱">
  <section class="studio-card" data-studio-dashboard>
    <div class="studio-welcome">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">PRIVATE BY DEFAULT / 默认私密</span><h2 data-studio-book-title>正在读取你的家谱…</h2><p
          data-studio-member-name
        >
        </p>
      </div><a class="button" data-studio-continue href="/studio/1-cover">从封面开始 <span>↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="studio-progress-summary" data-studio-progress-summary>正在计算完成进度…</p>
    <div class="studio-password" data-password-change hidden>
      <strong>先改初始密码</strong><p>为保护家人资料，请设置至少 8 位、同时含字母和数字的新密码；字母大小写均可。</p><form data-password-form>
        <label
          >新密码 <input name="password" type="password" minlength="8" autocomplete="new-password" required /></label
        ><button class="button" type="submit">保存新密码</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <ol class="studio-progress" data-studio-progress>
      {
        studioSteps.map((step) => (
          <li data-method={step.method}>
            <a href={`/studio/${step.slug}`}>
              <>
                <span>{String(step.method).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
                <strong>{step.title}</strong>
                <small>{step.english}</small>
                <em>未开始</em>
              </>
            </a>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
    <section class="studio-tools" data-studio-tools hidden aria-labelledby="studio-tools-title">
      <div class="studio-tools-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">NEXT TOOLS / 后续工具</span><h2 id="studio-tools-title">完成后，再整理成一本书</h2><p>
          你的家谱默认私密。网页预览、PDF 导出和章节公开申请会分别记录，不会自动公开家人资料。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="studio-tool-grid">
        <article class="studio-tool-card">
          <span class="eyebrow">AI ASSIST / AI 辅助</span>
          <strong><span data-ai-balance>—</span> 额度</strong>
          <p data-ai-status>供应商尚未启用，现阶段不会消耗额度。</p>
          <button class="text-link" type="button" disabled>AI 辅助尚未启用</button>
        </article>
        <article class="studio-tool-card">
          <span class="eyebrow">EXPORT / 导出</span>
          <strong>网页预览与 PDF</strong>
          <p>先在私密预览中检查八个章节，再用浏览器保存为 PDF。</p>
          <div class="studio-tool-actions">
            <a class="button" href="/studio/preview">打开私密预览</a><a class="text-link" href="/studio/preview" data-studio-pdf-link hidden
              >下载 PDF ↗</a
            >
          </div>
          <p class="studio-tool-note">PDF 下载入口是否显示，由学会管理员按需要开启；下载时会在浏览器打印窗口选择「存储为 PDF」。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="studio-tool-card">
          <span class="eyebrow">PUBLIC STORY / 公开故事</span>
          <strong>只公开你选择的章节</strong>
          <p>公开申请会与私有家谱分开保存；学会审核并发布前，章节不会出现在故事页。</p>
          <a class="text-link" href="/studio/publish">提交公开申请 ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <p class="studio-status" aria-live="polite" data-studio-status></p>
  </section>
</StudioFrame>
<script>
  import '../../scripts/studio-dashboard';
</script>
